# Copy to `.dev.vars` (ignored by git) for `pnpm run dev:api`. These are secrets of local
# development only; the production ones are set with `wrangler pages secret put`.
# Filled in by the pull requests that use them (p5-plan.md, M3 and M5):
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
#   GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
#   GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
